Create a class called Student.

The class should have three attributes:

name
age
grade (example: "8th", "9th")

Add three methods:

display_info(self)
→ prints the student's full information in a friendly sentence
Example: "Name: Ali, Age: 14, Grade: 8th"

promote(self)
→ increases the student’s grade by one level (simple string change like "8th" → "9th").

change_name(new_name)
→ updates the student's name -> self.name = new_name
